farm-transportation-budgets-e7952ede0c/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 08:02:23 +0000</pubDate><category>Fuel</category><description>Higher diesel prices are adding costs for Iowa farmers and trucking operators, according to Matt Wells, vice president of the Mid-West Truckers Association. Wells cited refinery shutdowns, declining fuel reserves and the war between Russia and Ukraine as factors tightening supply. He said two California refineries were shut down and a refinery in Joliet, Illinois, was offline for seven to ten days, while Ukrainian attacks damaged Russian refining facilities.

Wells said transportation rates and operating budgets will need to reflect the higher costs, potentially for the next year to year and a half, and he does not expect diesel prices to fall significantly soon. He also cautioned that fuel prices do not always return to earlier levels after a large increase. On red-dyed diesel, Wells said the modern dyed product is essentially the same fuel as clear highway diesel, and that its use on public roads remains subject to federal and state tax requirements and any specifically authorized exemptions.</description></item><item><title>Detroit Diesel Promises 2027 Engines With No Penalties, 3% TCO Savings</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/detroit-diesel-promises-2027-engines-with-no-penalties-3-tco-savings-27e3bb0783/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/detroit-diesel-promises-2027-engines-with-no-penalties-3-tco-savings-27e3bb0783/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:44:02 +0000</pubDate><category>Equipment</category><description>Commercial Carrier Journal</description></item><item><title>Cybersecurity Training for Fleets, AI Logistics Tools &amp; more</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/cybersecurity-training-for-fleets-ai-logistics-tools-more-aca4446e8b/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/cybersecurity-training-for-fleets-ai-logistics-tools-more-aca4446e8b/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 23:48:56 +0000</pubDate><category>Drivers &amp; Jobs</category><description>Commercial Carrier Journal</description></item><item><title>How ATA Wants to Fix ELD Certification</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/how-ata-wants-to-fix-eld-certification-a812fcb144/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/how-ata-wants-to-fix-eld-certification-a812fcb144/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 22:51:16 +0000</pubDate><category>Regulations</category><description>Heavy Duty Trucking</description></item><item><title>New York defeats FMCSA in major legal battle over non-domicil