imports and exports and are in current dollars, not adjusted for inflation, and they do not count truckloads or trucks crossing. The agency named Laredo and El Paso, Texas, and Otay Mesa, California, as leading truck crossings for Mexico freight, and Detroit and Port Huron, Michigan, and Buffalo, New York, for Canada.</description></item><item><title>What to Look for in Fleet Maintenance Software</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/what-to-look-for-in-fleet-maintenance-software-5dc22617e2/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/what-to-look-for-in-fleet-maintenance-software-5dc22617e2/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 15:25:15 +0000</pubDate><category>Equipment</category><description>Heavy Duty Trucking</description></item><item><title>Truckers should brace for crowded highways; 72.9 million travelers to hit the road for Thanksgiving holiday</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/truckers-should-brace-for-crowded-highways-72-9-million-travelers-to-h-8722617d12/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/truckers-should-brace-for-crowded-highways-72-9-million-travelers-to-h-8722617d12/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 15:22:32 +0000</pubDate><category>Industry</category><description>Truckers News</description></item><item><title>Court overturns $73.5M penalty for immigrant truck driver licenses</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/court-overturns-73-5m-penalty-for-immigrant-truck-driver-licenses-ebdfda0a3d/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/court-overturns-73-5m-penalty-for-immigrant-truck-driver-licenses-ebdfda0a3d/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 15:02:05 +0000</pubDate><category>Regulations</category><description>NewsNation</description></item><item><title>Diesel dips below $6 for first time since September</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/diesel-dips-below-6-for-first-time-since-september-46495c25db/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/diesel-dips-below-6-for-first-time-since-september-46495c25db/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 15:00:00 +0000</pubDate><category>Industry</category><description>Transport Topics</description></item><item><title>Groundtruth launches J.B. Hunt-backed AI invoice validation platform</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/groundtruth-launches-j-b-hunt-backed-ai-invoice-validation-platform-a1ee47749d/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/groundtruth-launches-j-b-hunt-backed-ai-invoice-validation-platform-a1ee47749d/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 14:46:09 +0000</pubDate><category>Industry</category><description>Truck News</description></item><item><title>USPS is set to make fuel surcharge permanent, raise parcel prices 5.9% in 2027</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/usps-is-set-to-make-fuel-surcharge-permanent-raise-parcel-prices-5-9-i-d760efa36b/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/usps-is-set-to-make-fuel-surcharge-permanent-raise-parcel-prices-5-9-i-d760efa36b/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 14:39:28 +0000</pubDate><category>Fuel</category><description>USPS wants its fuel surcharge made permanent, with the rate climbing from 8% to 11% on Jan. 17. The Postal Service has also proposed an average rate increase of 5.9% for four domestic package services, including Ground Advantage and Priority Mail. The changes were filed with the Postal Regulatory Commission on Thursday, after the Board of Governors approved them. The surcharge began in April as a temporary 8% increase set to expire Jan. 17, and USPS cited rising fuel prices in proposing the three-point hike. International products are not covered by the surcharge for now, but several international services would rise an average of 7.9%, and USPS is reworking its country rate groups.</description></item><item><title>Detroit Free Press. . Ford Vault is full of rare concept and race cars as part of the company’s heritage fleet. 🎥 Justin Wan/DFP</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/detroit-free-press-ford-vault-is-full-of-rare-concept-and-race-cars-as-3e8d760ee0/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/detroit-free-press-ford-vault-is-full-of-rare-concept-and-race-cars-as-3e8d760ee0/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 14:17:55 +0000</pubDate><category>Industry</category><description>Facebook</description></item><item><title>Best Way Trucking inks 187,000 sq. ft. renewal, extension in East Hanover, RRNNJ says</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/best-way-trucking-inks-187-000-sq-ft-renewal-extension-in-east-hanover-eb512cde1b/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/best-way-trucking-inks-187-000-sq-ft-renewal-extension-in-east-hanover-eb512cde1b/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 13:56:54 +0000</pubDate><category>Industry</category><description>Real Estate NJ</description></item><item><title>Kodiak AI taps MicroVision lidar for driverless highway trucking launch</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/kodiak-ai-taps-microvision-lidar-for-driverless-highway-trucking-launc-6f17397a00/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/kodiak-ai-taps-microvision-lidar-for-driverless-highway-trucking-launc-6f17397a00/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 13:29:59 +0000</pubDate><category>Equipment</category><description>Truck News</description></item><item><title>Private fleets in US capture more freight as dedicated trucking expands</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/private-fleets-in-us-capture-more-freight-as-dedicated-trucking-expand-39eda6d31f/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/private-fleets-in-us-capture-more-freight-as-dedicated-trucking-expand-39eda6d31f/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 13:04:57 +0000</pubDate><category>Industry</category><description>Journal of Commerce</description></item><item><title>Meta backs deployment of 25 electric trucks on California-Arizona freight corridor</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/meta-backs-deployment-of-25-electric-trucks-on-californ